{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","魔渊之引"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Gravitic Requiem"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤黑洞持续将敌人向中心吸引并造成伤害，黑洞中心处生命较低的敌人会被直接击败。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Cyran summons a black hole that continuously pulls enemies toward its center while dealing damage. Enemies with low HP within the center are immediately defeated."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，召唤中心区域半径为1格的黑洞持续5秒，黑洞每0.25秒对中心区域内的敌人造成16% + 2% ATK伤害，每0.25秒对中心区域外、距离4格以内的敌人造成6% + 1% ATK的伤害，并将所有敌人朝中心区域吸引，敌人距离黑洞中心越近受到的吸引力越大。处于黑洞中心区域的敌人，在当前生命值低于迪尔格雷600% + 20% ATK且生命值比例低于15% + 1%时会被立即击败。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cyran selects a tile and summons a black hole that lasts for 5s, with its center covering a 1-tile radius. Every 0.25s, enemies within the center take 16% + 2% ATK damage, and those outside the center but within 4 tiles take 6% + 1% ATK damage. All enemies on the battlefield are pulled toward the center, with the gravitational force increasing as they get closer. Enemies within the center are immediately defeated if their current HP is below Cyran's 600% + 20% ATK and their HP ratio is under 15% + 1%."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":87,"end":92,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":161,"end":167,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":182,"end":187,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":154,"end":159,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":227,"end":232,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":458,"end":464,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":500,"end":505,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":96,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":157,"end":171,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":151,"end":163,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":225,"end":236,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":454,"end":468,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至17% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至7% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the black hole's damage to enemies within the center to 17% + 2% ATK per 0.25s, and to enemies at the edges to 7% + 1% ATK per second."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":66,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":121,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至18% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至8% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the black hole's damage to enemies within the center to 18% + 2% ATK per 0.25s, and to enemies at the edges to 8% + 1% ATK per second."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":66,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":121,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至19% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至9% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the black hole's damage to enemies within the center to 19% + 2% ATK per 0.25s, and to enemies at the edges to 9% + 1% ATK per second."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":123,"end":128,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":59,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":66,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":121,"end":132,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","黑洞每0.25秒的伤害对中心区域内的敌人提高至20% + 2% ATK，对中心区域外的敌人提高至10% + 1% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the black hole's damage to enemies within the center to 20% + 2% ATK per 0.25s, and to enemies at the edges to 10% + 1% ATK per second."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":31,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":51,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":124,"end":129,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":35,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":66,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":121,"end":133,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","厄难之灾"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Arcane Barrage"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤暗黑法球对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Cyran casts 3 magic orbs to deal damage to enemies."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤3枚暗黑法球，依次向敌方最密集区域发射对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成65% + 7% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cyran casts 3 magic orbs towards the area with the most enemies, dealing 65% + 7% ATK damage to adjacent enemies."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":43,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":76,"end":81,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":73,"end":85,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至70% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 70% + 7% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至75% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 75% + 7% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至80% + 7% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 80% + 7% ATK."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","巫影魔爪"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","Cursed Grasp"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","使用魔法抓取最近的敌人，并将其砸向敌方最密集区域。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Cyran uses magic to lift the nearest enemy and hurls them into the area with the most enemies."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使用魔法将最靠近自己的1名敌人抓到半空禁锢1秒，随后将其砸向敌方最密集区域并使其倒地0.5秒，对其周围1格范围内的敌人造成150% + 10% ATK伤害。优先选择范围内不处于霸体或稳定状态的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cyran uses magic to lift the nearest enemy into the air, imprisoning them for 1s before hurling them into the area with the most enemies. This knocks the target down for 0.5s and deals 150% + 10% ATK damage to enemies within 1 tile of the target. When casting this skill, Cyran prioritizes targeting an enemy who is neither unaffected nor steadfast."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":189,"end":195,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":88,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":91,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":185,"end":199,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":324,"end":334,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":339,"end":348,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 160% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 170% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至180% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 180% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身暴击。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Increases Crit during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身暴击提高18点，终极技能“魔渊之引”击败过敌人后额外提高12点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","When in battle, Cyran increases his Crit by 18, and after defeating an enemy with Gravitic Requiem, his Crit is further increased by 12."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身暴击提高24点，终极技能“魔渊之引”击败过敌人后额外提高16点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","When in battle, Cyran increases his Crit by 24, and after defeating an enemy with Gravitic Requiem, his Crit is further increased by 16."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身暴击提高30点，终极技能“魔渊之引”击败过敌人后额外提高20点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","When in battle, Cyran increases his Crit by 30, and after defeating an enemy with Gravitic Requiem, his Crit is further increased by 20."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","邃黯回响"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Mystic Recollection"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","模仿记忆中的术式，在战斗开始时增强自身并对敌方发动攻击。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Cyran draws on spells from his memories, casting them when a battle starts to enhance himself and attack enemies."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","模仿梅林释放过且令人记忆深刻的术式，在战斗开始时，迪尔格雷依次释放以下技能：\n启明术：使自身获得30点急速持续8秒，持续期间处于霸体状态；\n禁锢术：对最靠后的1名敌人造成25% ATK伤害，并将其禁锢1.5秒，被禁锢的敌人无法行动；\n星陨术：制造一道黑暗焰流攻击场上所有敌人，对其造成40% ATK真实伤害，并使其攻击速度降低20点持续5秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Cyran mimics some of Merlin's impressive spells, casting them in the following sequence when a battle starts:\nEnlightening Spell: Grants himself 30 Haste for 8s, during which he is unaffected.\nConfining Spell: Deals 25% ATK damage to the rearmost enemy, imprisoning them for 1.5s and preventing them from moving or acting.\nStarshard Spell: Conjures a dark flame across the battlefield, dealing 40% ATK true damage to all enemies and reducing their ATK SPD by 20 for 5s."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":75,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":85,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":142,"end":149,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":181,"end":191,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":216,"end":223,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":238,"end":246,"tooltip_key":"keyword:backest"},{"start":394,"end":401,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","黑暗焰流的伤害提升至45% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases dark flame damage to 45% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若梅林出现在敌方战场，则在战斗开始时将其沉默8秒，沉默期间梅林无法释放技能，其原本在战斗开始时释放的技能会在沉默结束后释放，当沉默结束时，迪尔格雷损失5%当前生命值；若梅林未出现在敌方战场，则战斗开始时使自身永久提高10%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","If Merlin is present on the enemy side, Merlin is silenced for 8s when a battle starts, preventing Merlin from casting any skills. Any skills Merlin would've cast when a battle starts are triggered after silence ends, at which point Cyran loses 5% of his current HP. If Merlin is absent on the enemy side, Cyran permanently increases his ATK by 10%."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","黑暗焰流的伤害提升至50% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases dark flame damage to 50% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","额外获得初始能量。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Gains extra Initial Energy."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","额外获得200点初始能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Gains extra 200 Initial Energy."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","黯影魔杖"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Shadowveil Staff"]]}